To compress the timeline:

"You mentioned you need this by {date}. Let's work backwards:

• Legal review: {duration} 
• Procurement approval: {duration} 
• Technical validation: {duration} 
• Stakeholder alignment: {duration}

That means we'd need to have {milestone} completed by {earlier_date}. Does that timeline still work, or do we need to adjust?"

Making the process visible makes it manageable.
